-energy-research--world-scale-energy-transition-papers","content":"> **A three-paper series on the energy transition**, written by Bartosz\n> Osiej. Each paper follows the same discipline: real physics first,\n> honest arithmetic, hype last. Together they answer the transition's\n> three problems — micro-power where autonomy matters, multi-day storage\n> for the lull, and firm baseload for the backbone.\n>\n> All papers are open-access (CC-BY-4.0), readable in the browser below,\n> and downloadable as PDF. Source `.tex` files are available in the\n> repository."},"15":{"id":"/docs/energy-13","page_id":"/docs/energy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/energy#-1-atomic-batteries-betavoltaics","content":"**Betavoltaic Nuclear Batteries for Mobile Devices: A Comprehensive\nTechnical Review and Feasibility Analysis**"},"16":{"id":"/docs/energy-14","page_id":"/docs/energy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/energy#-1-atomic-batteries-betavoltaics","content":"*Bartosz Osiej — August 2026 · Review paper · CC-BY-4.0*"},"17":{"id":"/docs/energy-15","page_id":"/docs/energy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/energy#-1-atomic-batteries-betavoltaics","content":"Property"},"18":{"id":"/docs/energy-16","page_id":"/docs/energy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/energy#-1-atomic-batteries-betavoltaics","content":"Value"},"19":{"id":"/docs/energy-17","page_id":"/docs/energy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/energy#-1-atomic-batteries-betavoltaics","content":"**Title**"},"20":{"id":"/docs/energy-18","page_id":"/docs/energy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/energy#-1-atomic-batteries-betavoltaics","content":"Betavoltaic Nuclear Batteries for Mobile Devices: A Comprehensive Technical Review and Feasibility Analysis"},"21":{"id":"/docs/energy-19","page_id":"/docs/energy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/energy#-1-atomic-batteries-betavoltaics","content":"**Author**"},"22":{"id":"/docs/energy-20","page_id":"/docs/energy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/energy#-1-