strate migration —\n> each stage validated against a consciousness continuity metric (CCM)\n> derived from integrated information theory (IIT) and global workspace\n> theory (GWT). The estimated timeline for full implementation is 40–80\n> years; the first partial augmentation (10% volume, focused on memory\n> consolidation circuits) is plausible within 15–25 years given current\n> progress in high-density microelectrode arrays and neural interface\n> technology."},"594":{"id":"/docs/rd-101","page_id":"/docs/rd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/rd#-version-history-zenodo-1","content":"All versions of the concept record\n`10.5281/zenodo.21930639`:"},"595":{"id":"/docs/rd-102","page_id":"/docs/rd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/rd#-version-history-zenodo-1","content":"Version"},"596":{"id":"/docs/rd-103","page_id":"/docs/rd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/rd#-version-history-zenodo-1","content":"DOI"},"597":{"id":"/docs/rd-104","page_id":"/docs/rd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/rd#-version-history-zenodo-1","content":"Record"},"598":{"id":"/docs/rd-105","page_id":"/docs/rd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/rd#-version-history-zenodo-1","content":"v2 (latest)"},"599":{"id":"/docs/rd-106","page_id":"/docs/rd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/rd#-version-history-zenodo-1","content":"`10.5281/zenodo.21930640`"},"600":{"id":"/docs/rd-107","page_id":"/docs/rd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/rd#-version-history-zenodo-1","content":"21930640"},"601":{"id":"/docs/rd-108","page_id":"/docs/rd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/rd#-version-history-zenodo-1","content":"v1"},"602":{"id":"/docs/rd-109","page_id":"/docs/rd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/rd#-version-history-zenodo-1","content":"`10.5281/zenodo.21930639`"},"603":{"id":"/docs/rd-110","page_id":"/docs/rd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/rd#-version-history-zenodo-1","content":"21930639"},"604":{"id":"/docs/rd-111","page_id":"/docs/rd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/doc