nder-the-hood","content":"**Local files:** picking a file (or dropping it) reads it with\n`File.arrayBuffer()` and hands the raw bytes to `pdf.js`\n(`getDocument({ data })`) — the PDF never leaves the browser."},"792":{"id":"/docs/translator-59","page_id":"/docs/translator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/translator#️-how-it-works-under-the-hood","content":"**Text extraction:** `page.getTextContent()` returns positioned text spans;\nthey are joined into paragraphs and chunked (Google: \\~4 500 chars,\nMyMemory: \\~450 chars) to stay inside each API's limits."},"793":{"id":"/docs/translator-60","page_id":"/docs/translator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/translator#️-how-it-works-under-the-hood","content":"**Translation:** a small provider chain tries the keyless Google endpoint\nfirst and falls back to MyMemory. Auto-detection of the source language\nalso uses the Google endpoint."},"794":{"id":"/docs/translator-61","page_id":"/docs/translator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/translator#️-how-it-works-under-the-hood","content":"**Book layout:** pages are laid out as spreads (cover page alone on the\nright, then 2+3, 4+5, …). Page turns are CSS 3D transforms (`rotateY`) with\n`perspective`, so the moving page flips like a real leaf."},"795":{"id":"/docs/translator-62","page_id":"/docs/translator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/translator#-about-microsoft-translator","content":"This site originally asked for a **Microsoft Translator embedded API**. Two\nthings to know:"},"796":{"id":"/docs/translator-63","page_id":"/docs/translator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/translator#-about-microsoft-translator","content":"Microsoft's free **Translator Web Widget** (the classic embed) was\n**retired in 2019** — it no longer exists."},"797":{"id":"/docs/translator-64","page_id":"/docs/translator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/translator#-about-microsoft-translator","content":"The modern **Azure Translator REST API** works perfectly, but requires a\n**subscription key + region**, which cannot be shared on a public static\nsite."},"798":{"id":"/docs/translator-65","page_id":"/docs/translator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/translator#-about-microsoft-translator","content":"So this module ships **keyless by default** (Google + MyMemory, both free,\nCORS-enabled, no account). A **Microsoft Translator provider** is included\nbehind the same interface in `src/lib/translator.ts` — if you have an\nAzure key, pass `microsoftKey` / `microsoftRegion` to `translateText()` and it\nis tried first. The docs stay free and keyless for everyone else."},"799":{"id":"/docs/translator-66","page_id":"/docs/translator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/translator#-sample-files","content":"The two demo PDFs are generated from\n`scripts/gen-sample-pdfs.mjs`\n(a dependency-free PDF writer) and live in `public/pdfs/`:"},"800":{"id":"/docs/translator-67","page_id":"/docs/translator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/translator#-sample-files","content":"`sample-english.pdf` — 3 pages of English text"},"801":{"id":"/docs/translator-68","page_id":"/docs/translator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/translator#-sample-files","content":"`sample-polish.pdf` — 2 pages of Polish text"},"802":{"id":"/docs/translator-69","page_id":"/docs/translator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/translator#-related","content":"Docs Hub"},"803":{"id":"/docs/translator-70","page_id":"/docs/translator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/translator#-related","content":"Project catalog"},"804":{"id":"/docs/update-flow","page_id":"/docs/update-flow","type":"page","content":"Update Flow","breadcrumbs":["Catalog"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/update-flow"},"805":{"id":"/docs/update-flow-0","page_id":"/docs/update-flow","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/update-flow","content":"This page documents **which repositories publish updates to which**, including how this documentation site stays in sync with the source projects."},"806":{"id":"/docs/update