ype":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/projects/cybersec-tools/tests#reproduce","content":"Reproduce"},"1543":{"id":"/docs/projects/cybersec-tools/tests-3","page_id":"/docs/projects/cybersec-tools/tests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/cybersec-tools/tests#tests--cyberforge","content":"Full automated test results for **CyberForge*&#x2A;, collected during the QA sweep\non 2026-08-13 (Linux, Rust 1.97, Node 22, Python 3). Scroll down — the\ncounters count up, the bars fill in and every row animates as it enters the\nviewport. Use **▶ Replay animation** to run it again."},"1544":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","type":"page","content":"Architecture","breadcrumbs":["Catalog","📁 Projects","📜 Externum"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture"},"1545":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture-0","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","content":"Documentation for Architecture."},"1546":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture-1","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture#architecture","content":"Architecture"},"1547":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture-2","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture#pipeline","content":"Pipeline"},"1548":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture-3","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture#stages","content":"Stages"},"1549":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture-4","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture#module-system","content":"Module system"},"1550":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture-5","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture#project-structure","content":"Project structure"},"1551":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture-6","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture#api-contract","content":"API contract"},"1552":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture-7","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture#roadmap","content":"Roadmap"},"1553":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture-8","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture#stages","content":"**Lexer** (`lexer.py`) — tokenization: **bracket-aware** INDENT/DEDENT\n(indentation inside `()[]{}` is ignored, blank lines do not break blocks),\n`0b`/`0x` literals, strings + f-strings + triple-quoted, the full operator\nset, inline bash (`` `...` ``) and blocks (`%% ... %%`)."},"1554":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture-9","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture#stages","content":"**Parser** (`parser.py`) — recursive descent with operator precedence\n(matching Python), unary operators, ternary, lambdas, literals\n(lists/dicts/tuples/sets — including multi-line), indexing and slicing,\nattribute access, calls with kwargs/`*args`/`**args`, comprehensions,\ntuple unpacking and the full statement grammar: functions, classes with\ninheritance, `if/elif/else`, `while`, `for-in`, `try/except/else/finally`,\n`with`, `import`, `raise`, `assert`, `del`, `yield`, `global`, `nonlocal`."},"1555":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture-10","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture#stages","content":"**Compiler** (`compiler.py`) — code generation: to `python` (with\n`subprocess.run` for bash), `bash` (extracted commands) and `binary`\n(bit literals)."},"1556":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture-11","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture#stages","content":"**Runtime** (`runtime/`) — in-process execution via `exec` of the\ngenerated Python; a **meta-path finder** compiles `.ext` modules on\n`import`; a REPL with block-completeness detection."},"1557":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture-12","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture#module-system","content":"`externum/runtime/__init__.py` registers `_ExtFinder` in `sys.meta_path`.\n`import mod` finds `mod.ext` (or `pkg.mod.ext`) on the search path, compiles\nit to Python and loads it as a module — the standard library in `lib/` is\nwritten in Externum itself."},"1558":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture-13","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture#api-contract","content":"`externum/__init__.py` exposes the core (`Lexer`, `Parser`, `Compiler`,\n`Runtime`) plus **reserved** future modules: `llm` (LLMClient,\nPromptTemplate, FunctionSchema), `neural` (Tensor, Module, Linear, Conv2d,\nAttention, Autograd), `distributed` (Actor, Cluster, Stream, Channel),\n`types` (DependentType, RefinementType, EffectType), `spec` (Spec, Theorem,\nProof, Verify) and `debug` (TimeTravelDebugger, HotReloader). The imports\nare guarded — the package works without these modules."},"1559":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture-14","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture#roadmap","content":"Full language: classes, exceptions, modules, lambdas, comprehensions, generators"},"1560":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture-15","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture#roadmap","content":"REPL, module system, standard library, 118 tests"},"1561":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture-16","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture#roadmap","content":"`neural` module — tensors, autograd, layers (API contract in place)"},"1562":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture-17","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture#roadmap","content":"`llm` module — model integration (function calling)"},"1563":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture-18","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture#roadmap","content":"`distributed` module — actors and streams between processes"},"1564":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture-19","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/externum/architecture#roadmap","content":"Full `binary` target (assembler)"},"1565":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/compiler","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/compiler","type":"page","content":"Compiler & CLI","breadcrumbs":["Catalog","📁 Projects","📜 Externum"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/projects/externum/compiler"},"1566":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/compiler-0","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/compiler","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/externum/compiler","content":"Documentation for Compiler & CLI."},"1567":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/compiler-1","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/compiler","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/projects/externum/compiler#compiler--cli","content":"Compiler & CLI"},"1568":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/compiler-2","page_id":"/docs/projects/externum/compiler","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/projects/externum/compiler#commands","content":"Commands"},"1569":{"id":"/docs/projects/externum/compiler-3","page_id":"/docs/projec