 == 0`."},"4101":{"id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture-27","page_id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture#startup-sequence-monitorstart","content":"**Object load** — `aya::Ebpf::load_file` parses the compiled eBPF object."},"4102":{"id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture-28","page_id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture#startup-sequence-monitorstart","content":"**Program load + attach** — each `TracePoint` program attaches to\n`syscalls/sys_enter_execve` / `sys_enter_openat`."},"4103":{"id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture-29","page_id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture#startup-sequence-monitorstart","content":"**Map hand-off** — the `EVENTS` `PerfEventArray` moves into the reader thread."},"4104":{"id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture-30","page_id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture#startup-sequence-monitorstart","content":"**Channel** — MPSC connects reader thread → monitor."},"4105":{"id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture-31","page_id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture#reader-thread-talus-reader","content":"Enumerates online CPUs, opens one `PerfEventArrayBuffer` per CPU."},"4106":{"id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture-32","page_id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture#reader-thread-talus-reader","content":"Decodes batches into pre-allocated `BytesMut` pools (zero per-event\nallocation in the hot loop)."},"4107":{"id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture-33","page_id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture#reader-thread-talus-reader","content":"Counts `events.lost` (perf-buffer overruns) and forwards `Msg::Lost`."},"4108":{"id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture-34","page_id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture#reader-thread-talus-reader","content":"Idles 1 ms when no buffer has data — \\~1 ms latency, near-zero idle CPU."},"4109":{"id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture-35","page_id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture#monitor-core","content":"`handle_event` records stats, pushes `Open` timestamps onto the PID's sliding\nwindow, evicts entries older than 1 s, and emits an `Alert` exactly when the\nwindow crosses the configured threshold (`--alert-threshold`, `0` disables)."},"4110":{"id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture-36","page_id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture#output-layer","content":"`Monitor::poll` returns a `Vec&lt;Output&gt;` per tick (`Event` | `Alert`) routed by\nmode: **TUI** (frankentui: 7-panel cyberpunk interface — events, process tree,\nnetwork, top files, extensions, alerts, heatmap) · **JSON** (NDJSON) · **Plain**\n· **Diagnose** (verifies tracepoint IDs under `/sys/kernel/tracing/events`,\nloads + attaches, listens 5 s, prints counters)."},"4111":{"id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture-37","page_id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture#5-performance-characteristics","cont