layer spans four components (full details in the\nrepo's `ARCHITECTURE.md`\n§8 and `SECURITY.md`):"},"4126":{"id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture-52","page_id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture#6-licensing-subsystem","content":"Component"},"4127":{"id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture-53","page_id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture#6-licensing-subsystem","content":"Trust anchor"},"4128":{"id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture-54","page_id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture#6-licensing-subsystem","content":"`talus-keygen` (owner machine)"},"4129":{"id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture-55","page_id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture#6-licensing-subsystem","content":"Private key at `~/.secrets/talus/license-keys/` — never inside any repository"},"4130":{"id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture-56","page_id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture#6-licensing-subsystem","content":"Talus binary (`license.rs`)"},"4131":{"id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture-57","page_id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture#6-licensing-subsystem","content":"Embedded Ed25519 **public** key; compile-time XOR checksum detects binary tampering"},"4132":{"id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture-58","page_id":"/docs/projects/talus-process-monitor/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projec